        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/ea-sports-active-nfl-training-camp",
        "cached_at": 1778663191
      },
      {
        "id": 4829,
        "name": "Earth Seeker",
        "summary": "Earth Seeker is a Role-Playing game for the Nintendo Wii.\n\nThe battle system for facing off against these beasts is known as the \"Time Stop Battle\" system. It combines real time and command based elements. As you move about the battle field, you'll be able to lock on to enemies.\n\nThe camera will then set itself to keep the enemy in your sites. You can press A to pause the action and select commands from a command menu. Commands shown in the screenshots include such things as \"Blade Rush,\" \"Air Strike,\" and elemental attacks like \"Flame,\" \"Ice,\" and \"Thunder.\"",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co28fp.jpg",
        "release_date": 1308787200,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Role-playing (RPG)",
        "platform_ids": "5",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/earth-seeker",
        "cached_at": 1778663191
      },
      {
        "id": 4830,
        "name": "Emergency Heroes",
        "summary": "Become a real-life hero – drive the coolest, high-tech rescue vehicles to SAVE your city. \n \nEmergency Heroes is the open world rescue driving game that is designed for the next generation of young rescue heroes. \n \nRace to the scene in advanced police, fire and EMT rescue vehicles that let you jump over four-lane highways, power-slide into water towers and track down criminals at high speeds. By combining simple intuitive controls with fast, exhilarating action, Emergency Heroes offers an exciting experience the whole family can enjoy, exclusively on Wii™. \n \nDrive the next generation of rescue vehicles. Pilot and command numerous high-tech rescue vehicles designed specifically for ultra high-risk, high-speed navigation. Choose between police, fire and EMT vehicles. \nExplore and protect the entire city. As an emergency hero, your mission is to protect the peaceful city of San Alto. Drive through stunning free-roaming open environments, and keep the city safe at every turn. \nTwo player co-op. Challenge your friends or combine forces to form the ultimate rescue hero team to protect your city. \nFun for the whole family. Making full use of the Wii Remote™, everyone in the family can enjoy being an emergency hero. \nFast-action Gameplay. Take advantage of Hero Mode and play like you mean it – the faster you drive, the faster you rise and gain access to invincible powers.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/cjorbd2zjmusdtrrkw3t.jpg",
        "release_date": 1211846400,
        "rating": null,
