        "name": "Medieval Games",
        "summary": "Battle dragons! Storm castles! Swordfight! Relive the days of olde in this fun collection of 30 medieval-inspired mini games and tournament championships set in a charming storybook world. Featuring easy pick up and play action, light hearted humor and support for up to four players, Medieval Games is sure to be a family favorite.",
