      {
        "id": 50701,
        "name": "Bomberman Blast",
        "summary": "Look out for Bomberman Blast! There's 8-person online multiplayer and you can even use your Mii as a Bomberman!\n\nA brand new addition to the Bomberman series is available on WiiWare! Up to eight players can battle online simultaneously via Nintendo Wi-Fi Connection! Simple controls make this a great game for family and friends to enjoy at anytime! New items can be triggered by shaking the Wii Remote controller for excitement never before experienced in a Bomberman title! You can even take the intensity up another notch by adding your own Mii caricatures to the mix! Battle results can be recorded on Nintendo Wi-Fi Connection Ranking, so see how you stack up against others around the globe! This title will prove to be a blast for everyone--from those who've never touched a Bomberman game, to the Bomberman masters!",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3gjz.jpg",
